{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Affine.Loop_chain</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"arrayjit","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Ir","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Affine","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Loop_chain","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"Enclosing loop chains","href":"#enclosing-loop-chains","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<h3 id=\"enclosing-loop-chains\"><a href=\"#enclosing-loop-chains\" class=\"anchor\"></a>Enclosing loop chains</h3><p>An access or effect's enclosing loops form a single nested chain, outermost first. Unlike a routine's sibling loops (<a href=\"../Loop_ranges/index.html\"><code>Loop_ranges</code></a>), a single enclosing chain cannot bind the same loop symbol twice: shadowing would make a symbol's range ambiguous between outer and inner binders. <code>Loop_chain.t</code> enforces binder uniqueness at construction with a typed refusal (gh-ocannl-1628).</p><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-sexp_of_t\"><a href=\"#val-sexp_of_t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> sexp_of_t : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Sexplib0</span>.Sexp.t</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-include\"><details open=\"open\"><summary class=\"spec include\"><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">include</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ppx_compare_lib</span>.Equal.S <span class=\"keyword\">with</span> <span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">t</span> := <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">t</span></span></span></code></summary><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-equal\"><a href=\"#val-equal\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> equal : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base__Ppx_compare_lib</span>.equal</span></span></code></div></div></details></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-duplicate\"><a href=\"#type-duplicate\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> duplicate</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-duplicate.symbol\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-duplicate.symbol\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>symbol : <a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a>;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-duplicate.outer\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-duplicate.outer\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>outer : int * int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-duplicate.inner\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-duplicate.inner\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>inner : int * int;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-sexp_of_duplicate\"><a href=\"#val-sexp_of_duplicate\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> sexp_of_duplicate : <span><a href=\"#type-duplicate\">duplicate</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Sexplib0</span>.Sexp.t</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-equal_duplicate\"><a href=\"#val-equal_duplicate\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> equal_duplicate : <span><a href=\"#type-duplicate\">duplicate</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-duplicate\">duplicate</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec exception anchored\" id=\"exception-Duplicate_binder\"><a href=\"#exception-Duplicate_binder\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">exception</span> </span><span><span class=\"exception\">Duplicate_binder</span> <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> <a href=\"#type-duplicate\">duplicate</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-empty\"><a href=\"#val-empty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> empty : <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-is_empty\"><a href=\"#val-is_empty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> is_empty : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-length\"><a href=\"#val-length\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> length : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-enter\"><a href=\"#val-enter\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> enter : \u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(int * int)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"#type-t\">t</a>, <a href=\"#type-duplicate\">duplicate</a>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Result.t</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>enter chain s (lo, hi)</code>: appends an innermost binder <code>(s, (lo, hi))</code> to <code>chain</code> (ordered outermost first), refusing a symbol already bound in <code>chain</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-enter_exn\"><a href=\"#val-enter_exn\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> enter_exn : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>(int * int)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>As <a href=\"#val-enter\"><code>enter</code></a>, raising <a href=\"#exception-Duplicate_binder\"><code>Duplicate_binder</code></a> on a duplicate symbol.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-of_bindings\"><a href=\"#val-of_bindings\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> of_bindings : \u000A  <span><span><span>(<a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a> * <span>(int * int)</span>)</span> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"#type-t\">t</a>, <a href=\"#type-duplicate\">duplicate</a>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Result.t</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Builds a chain from an outermost-first binding list, refusing the first duplicate symbol.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-of_bindings_exn\"><a href=\"#val-of_bindings_exn\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> of_bindings_exn : <span><span><span>(<a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a> * <span>(int * int)</span>)</span> list</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>As <a href=\"#val-of_bindings\"><code>of_bindings</code></a>, raising <a href=\"#exception-Duplicate_binder\"><code>Duplicate_binder</code></a> on a duplicate symbol.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-map_symbols\"><a href=\"#val-map_symbols\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> map_symbols : \u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">f</span>:<span>(<span><a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>(<a href=\"#type-t\">t</a>, <a href=\"#type-duplicate\">duplicate</a>)</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Result.t</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Renames each bound symbol in order, refusing any rename that collides two binders.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-map_symbols_exn\"><a href=\"#val-map_symbols_exn\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> map_symbols_exn : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span class=\"label\">f</span>:<span>(<span><a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a>)</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>As <a href=\"#val-map_symbols\"><code>map_symbols</code></a>, raising <a href=\"#exception-Duplicate_binder\"><code>Duplicate_binder</code></a> on a collision.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-find\"><a href=\"#val-find\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> find : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>(int * int)</span> option</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-mem\"><a href=\"#val-mem\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> mem : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-to_alist\"><a href=\"#val-to_alist\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> to_alist : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><span>(<a href=\"../../Indexing/index.html#type-symbol\">Indexing.symbol</a> * <span>(int * int)</span>)</span> list</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The enclosing binders, outermost first.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-ranges\"><a href=\"#val-ranges\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> ranges : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"../Loop_ranges/index.html#type-t\">Loop_ranges.t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The chain viewed as a <a href=\"../Loop_ranges/index.html#type-t\"><code>Loop_ranges.t</code></a> box environment.</p></div></div>"}